 활동 및 혜택</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(60, 60, 60); font-family: NotoKR, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, gothic, 고딕, 새굴림, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">1)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">주요활동</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(60, 60, 60); font-family: NotoKR, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, gothic, 고딕, 새굴림, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">➀&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">효과적인 봉사단 활동 수행을 위한&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">일 역량 강화 워크숍 참석</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(3.29.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">))</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 58px; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(60, 60, 60); font-family: NotoKR, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, gothic, 고딕, 새굴림, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 24px; text-indent: -43.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">➁ AI 리터